# TODO 로그인 API 응답의 access token을 설정하세요.
@accessToken = REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN

### 월간 비용 대시보드
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/external-api-costs/dashboard?month=2026-08
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 기간별 사용량
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/external-api-costs/usage?from=2026-08-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-09-01T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 단가 및 예산 정책
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/external-api-costs/policies
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Google Places Text Search 단가 설정
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/external-api-costs/prices/google-places/text-search-enterprise
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitPriceKrw": 30000,
  "unitSize": 1000,
  "enabled": true
}

### Google Places 월간 예산 및 차단 설정
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/external-api-costs/budgets/google-places
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "monthlyBudgetKrw": 100000,
  "mode": "BLOCK",
  "enabled": true
}
